	// of the manifest's decoded `payload`, which is `imprint_sha256`. Verify it offline with
	// `cipherframe verify --timestamp`. An asset whose manifest has no token yet (anchoring is
	// off, the authority has not answered, or the manifest was re-signed and is not stamped yet)
