	//
	// Adds a subtitle track to a ready asset (M7-1, ADR 0043, ADR 0044). The body is
	// `multipart/form-data` with the member `file` (WebVTT or SRT; the format is read from the
	// content and SRT is converted to WebVTT), `language` (a BCP 47 tag such as `en` or `pt-BR`,
	// stored in canonical case), `label` (the text a player shows, 1 to 100 characters) and the
	// optional `default` (`true` or `false`). The file name the client sends is ignored and never
	// stored.
