	// start times never go backwards and that end after they start and no later than the asset's
	// duration plus two seconds, at most 20000 cues and 1000 characters and 12 lines per cue. Only
	// plain text and the WebVTT tags `b`, `i`, `u`, `v`, `lang` and `c` are kept; every other tag,
	// cue setting, identifier, note, style and region is dropped. Anything that breaks a rule is
	// `400 invalid_request` with a field error that names the cue and never quotes the file.
