	// (plain text: it is never read as markup, so `<b>` is shown as typed) and an optional
	// `speaker` (which becomes a `v` tag). The body is at most 4 MB. Requires the `assets:write`
	// scope. An asset of another tenant is `not_found`.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
	//
