	// UpdateWebhookEndpointWithBodyWithResponse Update a webhook endpoint
	//
	// Changes the fields that are sent: `url`, `events` (an empty list means every kind) and
	// `enabled`. Deliveries of a disabled endpoint wait and resume when it is enabled again.
